  "prefLabel": "Geo 103.05 Organization",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Geo 103.05 Organization. Beginning with the regular meeting in November and annually thereafter, the board shall meet and organize and, by election from among its members, select a chairperson, vice-chairperson and secretary.\n\nSource. #7524, eff 7-1-01",
